  "reference": "Wandījo 7",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwingīla mu ngalaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Noa gīkī, “Ingīlaga lūūlū ū bebe ū mu ngalaba, hamò nī kaya yako; nguno ū mu shibyalīlwe shenīshi, ū bebe naakūbonile ūlī ntūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī mbika ja ndimu janaga mpungatī pungatī, ng'hosha na ng'hīma. Alīyo ī shiinū, ī jene janaga ibīlī bīlī, najo ng'hosha na ng'hīma ja būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī noni ja būlī mbika, najo mpungatī pungatī, ng'hosha na ng'hīma; kūlwa kūlang'hana būlī lūnūngū lwikale lūpanga hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū jilashile shikū mpungatī kūfuma lelo īyī, nakwenha mbula ū mu sī, ītūle shikū makūmi anè, līīmi na būjikū; ī shiseeng'wa shipanga sha mu sī īsho naashibeeja, nashiyagaje shishile pye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Noa wīyīta pyī īyo akalagīlwa na SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lihūūma lya minzī aho līliza mu sī, ū Noa walī na būlamu bo myaka magana atandū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Noa wingīla ū mu ngalaba hamò na a bitūnja bakwe, nū nke na a bīnga bakwe, būpīla ī lihūūma lya minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimu ja būlī mbika, nī shiinū; pyī nī noni ja mbika jose, jikiza ibīlī ibīlī, pyī ī shiseeng'wa sha mu sī, nī shiinū ja kwigweesa ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jose pye jiza ū kūlī Noa, jilī ng'hosha na ng'hīma, jūyūshika jingīla ū mu ngalaba gīt'umo ū Mulungu walī wanagīīlīla ū Noa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiza kw'ihūūma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jashikaana ī shikū mpungatī, a minzī g'ihūūma giza ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lihūūma līkandya mu ng'waka gwa magana atandatū ū mu myaka ya būlamu bo ng'wa Noa. Lwalī lūshikū lw'ikūmi na mpungatī mu ng'weji gwa kabīlī; ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, pyī ī nzwīlo ja minzī ī ja mu gatī ya sī jūlugūlīlwa; nī myongo ya minzī ū kwigūlū yūlekelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī mbula yūtūla ītūlile a ha sī, kūshisha shikū makūmi anè, līīmi na būjikū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Noa akingīla ū mu ngalaba alī hamò na a bitūnja bakwe a ba Shemu na Hamu nū Yafeti; pyī nū nke na a bake ba bitūnja bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakingīla mo nī shiinū ja būlī mbika, nī ndimu ja mbika na mbika, pyī nī shiinū ja kwigweesa ha sī; nī noni, nī shingī pyī īsho shikalalaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseeng'wa shose īsho shilī na myūyī ya būpanga, shikiza ū kūlī Noa shilī shibīlī shibīlī, shingīla ū mu ngalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shiseeng'wa īsho shikingīla, shaalī ng'hosha na ng'hīma; kūlenganīla nū mumo ū Mulungu walī wanagīīlīla ū Noa, hūna ū SEEBA ūnugalīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbula īkamala shikū makūmi anè īkūtūlaga a ha sī; aho gakwīla a minzī, gībūūcha ī ngalaba yeleela higūlya, yīnga a ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī gongeja ū kūkwīla a higūla ya sī, nayo ī ngalaba īlīho dūhū a ha minzī īkweleelaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shose na shose kūlibījiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī gakakwīla no a ha sī, kūshisha būlī lūgūlū lūlīhu a ha sīlīlī y'igūlū lūlibījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī gongeja ū kūkwīla a ha sī, nose nī ngūlū ī ndīhu no no no jūlibījiwa ī jose; a minzī gūbiza higūlya yajo būlīhu bo kwegeela makono mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shiseeng'wa shipanga īsho ng'anda ng'anda ha sī, shūshila kūcha, noni, ndimu, shiinū, nī ja kwigweesa ha sī ī jose ūmo jigelelile; pye na a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī sha ha sī nyūūmu, īsho shikesheemelaga mu mūūlū shikashila kūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shiseeng'wa shipanga shūpyagūlwa gete shūshila ū mu sī, banhū, ndimu, shiinū, pyī nī ja kwigweesa ha sī; nī noni ja higūlya ī jose, jūshila ho gete. Noa iyene dūhū ūsaaga, na a babo walī nabo ū mu ngalaba; nī shiseeng'wa ī shingī īsho shaalīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī gakīkundīkīja ī sī kūshisha lyūbīta ikanza lya shikū igana na makūmi atanò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
